            "review_title": "Review at Topping Beef",
            "review_text": "Marionrubin\nLondon, United Kingdom27 contributions\n0\nService needs attention\nDec 2022 • Family\nWe’d read the reviews and thought we’d give it a whirl despite the reviews being mixed. The restuarant looks fab but unfortunately the service very poor. They forgot my mums salmon dish and when it did arrive another 25 mins later after everyone else it was raw inside. The rest of our party had finished dessert and our poor mum hadn’t even had her meal. What a shame as we had high hopes!!!\nRead more\nWritten December 27, 2022",
